  "reasoning": "The defendant used a steel pipe to smash the victim’s shop, destroying icebox, computer monitor and other items valued 2609.78 yuan. This intentional destruction of property matches the statutory offense 故意毁坏财物. The assault causing heavy injury would correspond to 故意伤害罪, which is not in the provided lexicon, and no other listed offenses (fraud, bribery, etc.) apply.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]故意毁坏财物<eoa>"
}
